{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舰炮轰击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","艦砲射撃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌方英雄发射火炮，造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵英雄に砲弾を発射し、範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","依次对所有敌方英雄发射1枚火炮，至少发射5枚火炮，火炮对1格范围内的敌人造成320% + 30% ATK伤害，对1格范围的友军造成100% ATK伤害，同一个角色重复受到2次以上的火炮伤害降低为20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵英雄全体に順番に砲弾を1発ずつ発射し、5発以上の砲弾を放つ。砲弾は半径1マス以内の敵に320% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、半径1マス範囲内の味方に100% ATKのダメージを与える。同じキャラクターが砲弾によるダメージを2回以上受けた場合、2回目以降のダメージは20%にDOWN"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":87,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","砲弾が敵に与えるダメージが330% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","砲弾が敵に与えるダメージが340% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_ty