ption_i18n/jp","8 + 0.5秒間、霊体状態になる。霊体状態の間、物理ダメージ無効、毎秒-70% − 10% ATKのHPを回復。パッシブ効果：必殺技発動時、4秒間の霊体状態になる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":1,"end":7,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-80% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","霊体状態の間、毎秒のHP回復量が-80% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-90% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","霊体状態の間、毎秒のHP回復量が-90% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-100% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","霊体状態の間、毎秒のHP回復量が-100% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","猎能横斩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","吸収の斬撃"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围敌人造成伤害并偷取能量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","扇状範囲内の敵にダメージを与え、SPを奪う"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对2格扇形范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并偷取其70 + 5点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","2マスの扇状範囲内の敵に240% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、対象のSPを70 + 5奪う"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":36,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":43,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，偷取能量提升至80 + 5。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUPし、SPの奪取量が80 + 5にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRat